---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const EFFECTIVE_DATE = 'June 1, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — AutoPilot"
  description="How AutoPilot collects, uses, and protects your data."
>
  <header class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-40 border-b border-surface-border bg-surface/80 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-text-primary">
        <span class="text-amber">⬡</span> AutoPilot
      </a>
      <a href="https://app.yoursaas.com/register" class="btn-primary text-sm py-2">Get started free</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="pt-24 pb-24 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="section-label mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl text-text-primary mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted font-mono mb-12">Effective date: {EFFECTIVE_DATE}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-saas space-y-10">

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">1. Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          We collect information you provide directly (email address, workspace name, billing details),
          information generated automatically when you use the platform (automation run logs, token usage,
          audit events), and information from third-party OAuth providers you connect (limited to the
          scopes you grant).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">2. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul class="list-none space-y-2 text-text-secondary font-body">
          {[
            'To provide, maintain, and improve the platform.',
            'To process payments via Stripe (we never store raw card details).',
            'To send transactional emails (verification, password reset, invoices).',
            'To enforce rate limits, detect abuse, and maintain security.',
            'To aggregate anonymised usage analytics for product improvements.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-amber mt-1 flex-shrink-0">‣</span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">3. Data storage and security</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          All data is stored on servers located in the European Union or United States depending on your
          selected deployment region. OAuth tokens and API keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM.
          All traffic is encrypted in transit using TLS 1.3. Access to production databases requires
          multi-factor authentication and is logged in our audit trail.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">4. Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          We use Stripe for payment processing, Anthropic’s Claude API for AI inference,
          and Railway for infrastructure hosting. Each provider’s own privacy policy governs
          their use of data. We do not sell your data to third parties.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">5. Data retention</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          Automation run logs and audit events are retained for 90 days on the Free plan,
          12 months on Starter and Pro, and indefinitely on Enterprise (configurable).
          After account deletion, all personal data is anonymised within 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">6. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          You may request a copy of your data, correction of inaccuracies, or deletion of your account
          at any time via the Settings &rarr; Account page or by emailing
          <a href="mailto:privacy@yoursaas.com" class="text-amber hover:underline">privacy@yoursaas.com</a>.
          EU residents have additional rights under GDPR including the right to portability and the
          right to restrict processing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">7. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          We use one strictly necessary cookie to store your authentication refresh token.
          We do not use advertising or tracking cookies. The landing site uses no cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section data-reveal>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-text-primary mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary font-body leading-relaxed">
          Questions about this policy? Email
          <a href="mailto:privacy@yoursaas.com" class="text-amber hover:underline">privacy@yoursaas.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-surface-border py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <span class="font-display font-bold text-text-primary"><span class="text-amber">⬡</span> AutoPilot</span>
      <nav class="flex gap-6 text-sm text-text-muted">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-text-primary">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">Terms</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">Pricing</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
